    "title": "Bring Me The Horizon to bring 2026 tour to Kansas City - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alyssa Mueller ,\n2 days ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. — British rock band Bring Me the Horizon has extended touring plans into 2026, which includes a stop in Kansas City. The band’s North American “Ascension Program 2” tour will stop in Kansas City on May 12, 2026 at the T-Mobile Center. Tickets... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
